# 🌌 Interests

The topics I write about, organized as collections on my main site. These links go to the clearnet HTTP, and will open in a regular web browser.

=> https://brennan.day/collections/ All Collections

=> https://brennan.day/collections/personal-favourites/ Personal Favourites: A curated selection of my best and most beloved work across all genres and topics.

=> https://brennan.day/collections/writing-craft/ Writing Craft: Essays on the art and practice of writing. Technique, process, and the life of a writer.

=> https://brennan.day/collections/indieweb/ IndieWeb: Building and living on the independent web. Personal sites, protocols, principles, and digital ownership.

=> https://brennan.day/collections/community/ Community: On belonging, connection, and the power of people coming together, both online and off.

=> https://brennan.day/collections/technical-tutorials/ Technical Tutorials: Step-by-step guides for building things on the web and working with developer tools.

=> https://brennan.day/collections/politics/ Politics: Commentary on power, justice, and the political forces shaping our world.

=> https://brennan.day/collections/culture/ Culture: Critical takes on film, television, music, and the art we consume together.

=> https://brennan.day/collections/lyric-essays/ Lyric Essays: Essays that blur the line between prose and poetry. Fragmentary, associative, and deeply personal.

=> https://brennan.day/collections/ai/ AI: Reflections on artificial intelligence, machine learning, and what it means to be human in an age of thinking machines.

=> https://brennan.day/collections/history/ History: Essays on the past and events, figures, and movements that shaped the world we live in today.

=> https://brennan.day/collections/science/ Science: Explorations of scientific discovery, research, and the natural world, ranging from physics to biology to astronomy.

=> https://brennan.day/collections/indigenous/ Indigenous: Writing on Indigenous identity, Métis heritage, Treaty 7 territory, and sovereignty and resurgence.

=> https://brennan.day/collections/religion/ Religion: Essays on faith, spirituality, religious traditions, and the search for meaning.

=> https://brennan.day/collections/french/ French: Culture, littérature et mon parcours avec la langue française.

